create or replace function public.online_adventure_blocked(px int,py int,f int,s jsonb) returns boolean language plpgsql stable security definer set search_path=public,pg_temp as $$
declare cfg jsonb;g jsonb;p jsonb;
begin
 if f=2 then return px<1 or py<1 or px>11 or py>9 or (px=5 and py=6);end if;
 select data into cfg from online_adventure_config where id='floor1';
 if px<0 or py<0 or px>=88 or py>=34 or substring(cfg->'rows'->>py from px+1 for 1)<>'.' then return true;end if;
 for g in select jsonb_array_elements(cfg->'gates') loop if not(s->'keys' ? (g->>'key')) and px>=(g->>'x')::int and px<(g->>'x')::int+(g->>'w')::int and py>=(g->>'y')::int and py<(g->>'y')::int+(g->>'h')::int then return true;end if;end loop;
 for p in select jsonb_array_elements(cfg->'props') loop if px=(p->>'x')::int and py=(p->>'y')::int then return true;end if;end loop;
 for p in select jsonb_array_elements(cfg->'solids') loop if px>=(p->>'x')::int and px<(p->>'x')::int+(p->>'w')::int and py>=(p->>'y')::int and py<(p->>'y')::int+(p->>'h')::int then return true;end if;end loop;
 return false;
end$$;
create or replace function public.online_adventure_tick(rid uuid) returns void language plpgsql security definer set search_path=public,pg_temp as $$
declare room public.online_adventure_rooms;s jsonb;cfg jsonb;enemies jsonb;enemy jsonb;home jsonb;m public.online_adventure_members;tele jsonb;danger jsonb:='[]';nx int;ny int;dist int;i int;phase int;hx int;hy int;radius int;tx int;ty int;dx int;dy int;remaining int;warn jsonb;facing text;attack boolean;
begin
 select * into room from online_adventure_rooms where id=rid for update;
 -- A short shared action window coalesces simultaneous party actions. Polling alone never advances combat.
 if room.status<>'active' or room.pending_step_at is null or room.pending_step_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '100 milliseconds' or room.last_tick>clock_timestamp()-interval '160 milliseconds' then return;end if;
 if not exists(select 1 from online_adventure_members a join online_presence p on p.character_id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.finished_at is null and a.floor=1 and p.location='dungeon' and p.seen_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '3 seconds') then update online_adventure_rooms set pending_step_at=null where id=rid;return;end if;
 select data into cfg from online_adventure_config where id='floor1';s:=room.snapshot;enemies:=s->'enemies';phase:=coalesce((s->>'tick')::int,0);
 for tele in select jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(s->'telegraphs','[]')) loop
  remaining:=coalesce((tele->>'remaining')::int,1)-1;
  if remaining>0 then danger:=danger||jsonb_build_array(tele||jsonb_build_object('remaining',remaining));continue;end if;
  for m in select a.* from online_adventure_members a join online_presence p on p.character_id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.finished_at is null and a.floor=1 and p.location='dungeon' and p.seen_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '3 seconds' loop
   if exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(tele->'tiles') t where (t->>'x')::int=m.x and (t->>'y')::int=m.y) then update online_characters set hp=greatest(0,hp-greatest(2,(tele->>'damage')::int-public.online_adventure_defence(id))) where id=m.character_id;end if;
  end loop;
 end loop;
 for i in 0..jsonb_array_length(enemies)-1 loop
  enemy:=enemies->i;if (enemy->>'hp')::int<=0 then continue;end if;
  select value into home from jsonb_array_elements(cfg->'enemies') where value->>'id'=enemy->>'id';hx:=(home->>'x')::int;hy:=(home->>'y')::int;radius:=case when enemy ? 'boss' then 7 when enemy ? 'elite' then 5 else 7 end;
  nx:=(enemy->>'x')::int;ny:=(enemy->>'y')::int;attack:=false;
  select a.* into m from online_adventure_members a join online_presence p on p.character_id=a.character_id join online_characters c on c.id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.finished_at is null and a.floor=1 and c.hp>0 and p.location='dungeon' and p.seen_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '3 seconds' and abs(a.x-hx)<=radius and abs(a.y-hy)<=radius order by abs(a.x-nx)+abs(a.y-ny),a.character_id limit 1;
  if m.id is null then tx:=hx;ty:=hy;else tx:=m.x;ty:=m.y;end if;
  dx:=tx-nx;dy:=ty-ny;dist:=abs(dx)+abs(dy);facing:=case when abs(dx)>abs(dy) then case when dx>0 then 'right' else 'left' end else case when dy<0 then 'up' else 'down' end end;
  if dist>0 then enemy:=enemy||jsonb_build_object('dir',facing);end if;
  -- Regular melee and pursuit continue even while a numbered area attack is charging.
  if m.id is not null and dist<=1 then
   update online_characters set hp=greatest(0,hp-greatest(1,(enemy->>'atk')::int-public.online_adventure_defence(id))) where id=m.character_id;attack:=true;
  elsif dist>0 then
   for dx,dy in select v.x,v.y from (values(1,0),(-1,0),(0,1),(0,-1)) v(x,y) order by abs(nx+v.x-tx)+abs(ny+v.y-ty) loop
    if abs(nx+dx-hx)>radius or abs(ny+dy-hy)>radius or public.online_adventure_blocked(nx+dx,ny+dy,1,s) then continue;end if;
    if exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(enemies) e where e->>'id'<>enemy->>'id' and (e->>'hp')::int>0 and (e->>'x')::int=nx+dx and (e->>'y')::int=ny+dy) or exists(select 1 from online_adventure_members a join online_presence p on p.character_id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.floor=1 and a.finished_at is null and p.location='dungeon' and p.seen_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '3 seconds' and a.x=nx+dx and a.y=ny+dy) then continue;end if;
    if abs(nx+dx-tx)+abs(ny+dy-ty)>=dist then continue;end if;
    nx:=nx+dx;ny:=ny+dy;enemy:=enemy||jsonb_build_object('x',nx,'y',ny,'dir',case when dx>0 then 'right' when dx<0 then 'left' when dy>0 then 'down' else 'up' end);exit;
   end loop;
  end if;
  enemy:=enemy||jsonb_build_object('attackBeat',case when attack then phase+1 else coalesce((enemy->>'attackBeat')::int,-1) end);
  if m.id is not null and (enemy ? 'boss' or enemy ? 'elite') and not exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(danger) t where t->>'source'=enemy->>'id') and phase%6=0 then
   warn:='[]';if phase%12=0 then for tx in m.x-1..m.x+1 loop for ty in m.y-1..m.y+1 loop if not public.online_adventure_blocked(tx,ty,1,s) then warn:=warn||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('x',tx,'y',ty));end if;end loop;end loop;
   else for dx in -3..3 loop if not public.online_adventure_blocked(nx+dx,ny,1,s) then warn:=warn||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('x',nx+dx,'y',ny));end if;if dx<>0 and not public.online_adventure_blocked(nx,ny+dx,1,s) then warn:=warn||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('x',nx,'y',ny+dx));end if;end loop;end if;
   danger:=danger||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('source',enemy->>'id','tiles',warn,'remaining',3,'damage',case when enemy ? 'boss' then case when (enemy->>'hp')::int<240 then 24 else 18 end else 12 end,'name',case when phase%12=0 then '結晶落下' else '十字の裂光' end));
  end if;
  enemies:=jsonb_set(enemies,array[i::text],enemy);
 end loop;
 for m in select a.* from online_adventure_members a join online_characters c on c.id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.finished_at is null and c.hp<=0 loop
  select x,y into nx,ny from generate_series(3,9) gx(x) cross join generate_series(12,16) gy(y) where not public.online_adventure_blocked(x,y,1,s) and not exists(select 1 from online_adventure_members a join online_presence p on p.character_id=a.character_id where a.room_id=rid and a.character_id<>m.character_id and a.floor=1 and p.location='dungeon' and a.x=gx.x and a.y=gy.y) order by abs(x-5)+abs(y-14) limit 1;
  update online_adventure_members set x=coalesce(nx,5),y=coalesce(ny,14),floor=1 where id=m.id;update online_characters set hp=50 where id=m.character_id;
 end loop;
 update online_adventure_rooms set snapshot=s||jsonb_build_object('enemies',enemies,'tick',phase+1,'telegraphs',danger),pending_step_at=null,last_tick=clock_timestamp() where id=rid;
end$$;
-- Retain existing saves, HP, opened chests and rewards; discard obsolete timed warnings.
update public.online_adventure_rooms set snapshot=snapshot||'{"telegraphs":[]}'::jsonb,pending_step_at=null;
do $$declare a online_adventure_members;r online_adventure_rooms;loot online_adventure_loot;cfg jsonb;e jsonb;home jsonb;es jsonb;i int;nx int;ny int;begin
 select data into cfg from online_adventure_config where id='floor1';
 for a in select * from online_adventure_members where finished_at is null and floor in(1,2) order by id loop
  select * into r from online_adventure_rooms where id=a.room_id;
  if public.online_adventure_blocked(a.x,a.y,a.floor,r.snapshot) then
   select x,y into nx,ny from generate_series(3,9) gx(x) cross join generate_series(case when a.floor=2 then 5 else 12 end,case when a.floor=2 then 9 else 16 end) gy(y) where not public.online_adventure_blocked(x,y,a.floor,r.snapshot) and not exists(select 1 from online_adventure_members m where m.room_id=a.room_id and m.id<>a.id and m.floor=a.floor and m.finished_at is null and m.x=gx.x and m.y=gy.y) order by abs(x-5)+abs(y-case when a.floor=2 then 8 else 14 end),y,x limit 1;
   update online_adventure_members set x=nx,y=ny where id=a.id;
  end if;
 end loop;
 for loot in select * from online_adventure_loot loop
  select * into r from online_adventure_rooms where id=loot.room_id;if public.online_adventure_blocked(loot.x,loot.y,loot.floor,r.snapshot) then
   select x,y into nx,ny from generate_series(greatest(0,loot.x-8),loot.x+8) gx(x) cross join generate_series(greatest(0,loot.y-8),loot.y+8) gy(y) where not public.online_adventure_blocked(x,y,loot.floor,r.snapshot) order by abs(x-loot.x)+abs(y-loot.y),y,x limit 1;
   if nx is not null then update online_adventure_loot set x=nx,y=ny where id=loot.id;end if;
  end if;
 end loop;
 for r in select * from online_adventure_rooms where status='active' loop
  es:=r.snapshot->'enemies';for i in 0..jsonb_array_length(es)-1 loop e:=es->i;if (e->>'hp')::int>0 and public.online_adventure_blocked((e->>'x')::int,(e->>'y')::int,1,r.snapshot) then
   select value into home from jsonb_array_elements(cfg->'enemies') where value->>'id'=e->>'id';
   select x,y into nx,ny from generate_series((home->>'x')::int-3,(home->>'x')::int+3) gx(x) cross join generate_series((home->>'y')::int-3,(home->>'y')::int+3) gy(y) where not public.online_adventure_blocked(x,y,1,r.snapshot) and not exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(es) other where other->>'id'<>e->>'id' and (other->>'hp')::int>0 and (other->>'x')::int=gx.x and (other->>'y')::int=gy.y) order by abs(x-(home->>'x')::int)+abs(y-(home->>'y')::int) limit 1;
   es:=jsonb_set(es,array[i::text],e||jsonb_build_object('x',nx,'y',ny));
  end if;end loop;update online_adventure_rooms set snapshot=jsonb_set(snapshot,'{enemies}',es) where id=r.id;
 end loop;
end$$;
alter function public.online_world(text,jsonb) rename to online_world_v6;
revoke all on function public.online_world_v6(text,jsonb) from public,anon,authenticated;
create function public.online_world(action text,payload jsonb default '{}') returns jsonb language plpgsql security definer set search_path=public,pg_temp as $$
declare uid uuid:=auth.uid();p online_presence;m online_adventure_members;r online_adventure_rooms;result jsonb;target_floor int;cx int;cy int;
begin
 if uid is null or coalesce((auth.jwt()->>'is_anonymous')::boolean,true) then raise exception 'ログインしてください。';end if;
 perform pg_advisory_xact_lock(71390119);perform pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtextextended(uid::text,0));
 select * into p from online_presence where user_id=uid;select * into m from online_adventure_members where character_id=p.character_id and finished_at is null;select * into r from online_adventure_rooms where id=m.room_id;
 if action in('room_create','room_join','room_enter','room_teleport','room_return','room_finish','room_abandon') or action='interact' and payload->>'id'='entry_crystal' then
  if p.location='dungeon' then
   cx:=5;cy:=case when m.floor=2 then 6 else 12 end;
   if abs(m.x-cx)+abs(m.y-cy)>2 then raise exception '入口のクリスタルに近づいて右クリックしてください。';end if;
  elsif p.location<>'town' or abs(p.x-3)+abs(p.y-9)>3 then raise exception '町の冒険掲示板に近づいてください。';end if;
 end if;
 if action in('room_enter','room_teleport') then
  target_floor:=coalesce((payload->>'floor')::int,1);
  if target_floor not between 1 and 50 or target_floor>2 then raise exception 'この層はまだ実装されていません。';end if;
  if target_floor=2 and not(r.snapshot->'discovered' ? 'depth2') then raise exception 'その層にはまだ到達していません。';end if;
  if payload ? 'area' and payload->>'area' not in('entry','depth2') then raise exception '転送先は層の入口を選んでください。';end if;
  payload:=payload||jsonb_build_object('area',case when target_floor=2 then 'depth2' else 'entry' end);
 end if;
 if action='interact' and payload->>'id'='entry_crystal' then result:=public.online_world_v6('poll','{}');
 else result:=public.online_world_v6(action,payload);end if;
 if p.location='dungeon' and m.floor=1 and action in('move','wait','attack','skill') then update online_adventure_rooms set pending_step_at=coalesce(pending_step_at,clock_timestamp()) where id=m.room_id and status='active';end if;
 if action in('room_return','leave') and m.room_id is not null and not exists(select 1 from online_adventure_members a join online_presence pr on pr.character_id=a.character_id where a.room_id=m.room_id and pr.location='dungeon' and pr.seen_at>clock_timestamp()-interval '3 seconds') then update online_adventure_rooms set pending_step_at=null where id=m.room_id;end if;
 return result;
end$$;
revoke all on function public.online_world(text,jsonb) from public,anon;grant execute on function public.online_world(text,jsonb) to authenticated;
revoke all on function public.online_adventure_tick(uuid),public.online_adventure_blocked(int,int,int,jsonb) from public,anon,authenticated;
notify pgrst,'reload schema';
commit;
